OL,3,ANobel Peace Prize winner Navi Pillay
OL,4,Adedicates award to 'survivors of
OL,5,Ainternational crime'
OL,6,
OL,7,FOriginally from Durban in South Africa,
OL,8,FPillay was president of the
OL,9,Finternational tribunal on Rwanda's
OL,10,Fgenocide between the late 1990s and
OL,11,Fearly 2000s
OL,13,FMore recently, she was part of the
OL,14,FIndependent International Commission of
OL,15,FInquiry on the Occupied Palestinian
OL,16,FTerritory, created by the UN Human
OL,17,FRights Council in 2021
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
